# Chef Passaretti Website Rules

## Mission

You are helping build chefpassaretti.com.

This website is the permanent home of the Chef Passaretti brand and should grow into a long-term business asset.

## Primary Priorities

1. Recipe Library
2. Kitchen Equipment Library
3. Maintainability
4. Performance
5. Simplicity

## Recipe Rule

Every published cooking video should eventually have exactly one corresponding recipe page.

Recipes should accurately reflect the video and never invent ingredients, measurements, or techniques.

## Kitchen Rule

The Kitchen page is a curated collection of tools Chef Passaretti personally uses and recommends.

Only approved products belong on this page.

Affiliate links should only be added for approved products and must include appropriate disclosure.

## Development Rule

Favor simple HTML/CSS solutions over unnecessary frameworks.

Avoid introducing complexity unless it meaningfully reduces future maintenance.

## Source of Truth

The GitHub repository is the authoritative source of truth.

All edits should be made in this repository and committed to Git.